  (text "Power in. 5.1k on each CC. 5.7u on VBUS. U3: 5 V to 3.3 V. U4: 3.3 V to the core's 1.1 V."
    (at 10.16 12.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ddf18a54-c2b1-1dd6-7ee8-878eaebd546e")
  )
  (text "The link: USB to UART1 and nothing else. DTR and RTS reach nothing."
    (at 10.16 86.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "513fd70e-55f6-fe79-a7d7-1587b981811b")
  )
  (text "The RP2350A. Its own core regulator is not used: FB to ground, LX open, its supplies on 3.3 V (datasheet, figure 24)."
    (at 203.2 7.62 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "495d22e6-49b8-e980-c410-a3d390e38975")
  )
  (text "The key that signs: I2C0, 4.7k pull-ups."
    (at 360.68 12.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9d527b52-d4a7-df39-3c29-eeadc34a5bfc")
  )
  (text "The screen's ribbon, and its backlight from 5 V: GPIO13 high is on."
    (at 360.68 68.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "89da6be3-1ed8-4cd5-5a62-a9b8e345faeb")
  )
  (text "The flash, 16 MB. Left off when U1 is an RP2354A, which has its own inside (BUILD)."
    (at 370.84 152.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fd9ed186-9cc0-8c06-bac7-7b409e2c92ea")
  )
  (text "D0, D1, D2 to ground; the LED."
    (at 10.16 157.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "2eb0883c-67b8-ca42-222d-b67e93435b74")
  )
  (text "The way in for firmware: SWD on J3 and the pads on the back. Nothing here is reached through the USB-C."
    (at 10.16 223.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "885abd39-5756-ee5d-1314-83c372735ec2")
  )
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
